From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 11:13:20 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 32/54] Adapt tests and runtime behavior to the upgraded
 releases

Fix what the upgraded releases change at run time or in test expectations: rtc 0.21's interceptor API, tokio-util's Bytes requirement, jsonwebtoken 11's crypto backend, pulldown-cmark 0.13's task list output, opentelemetry-proto 0.33's string-encoded integers, the OpenTelemetry SDK's export error events, schemars 1's web.run schema hashes, and opentelemetry-otlp 0.33's retries, which need the real HTTP status. Two test servers now read the request before answering, which hyper requires under reqwest 0.13. unicode-width stays at 0.2.2, because ratatui-core 0.1.2 compensates for 0.2.2's zero-width halfwidth sound marks and would count them twice under 0.2.3.
